index.aff, index.dic.zlib (zlib-compressed index.dic): Swedish (sv_SE) Hunspell dictionary,
sv-FI.dic: the entries only the Finland-Swedish (sv_FI) dictionary has, added on load.
Source: https://github.com/wooorm/dictionaries (dictionaries/sv and dictionaries/sv-FI, 4.0.0).

This Swedish Dictionary for Spell Checking is maintained by
Göran Andersson <goran@init.se>.

